kly thrashed lost and  of course repurposed by a super villain  to try and kill spider-man one of the  most subtle Easter eggs in the film  comes when Aunt May sees Olivia Octavius  and calls her live as the villain told  spider-man earlier in the film her  enemies call her Doc Ock but her friends  call her Liv the fact that Aunt May  knows and uses doc Ock's nickname hints  at a previous relationship between the  two  but what did that relationship look like  well if miles is universe is anything  like the regular Marvel Universe  chances are the Doc Ock and Aunt May may  have had a pretty close relationship  like almost getting married it all  happened in amazing spider-man number  131 which featured the eight armed  menace nearly marrying Spidey's and in  order to claim a nuclear power plant  that may received from a recent  inheritance may does seem to have a  thing for genius inventors it's so hard  for me to believe that she's someone's  aunt yeah becoming all shapes and sizes  you know this one that date loaf is  exceptions you stop you their fans were  no doubt surprised to see Peter Parker  bite the bullet early on in the film  fans might have been even more surprised  when Peter takes off his mask and his  hair is blonde  instead of the expected brown that's  because the filmmakers are paying  tribute to the original duplicate  spider-man Ben Riley in the comics Riley  was a clone of Peter Parker who dyed his  hair and changed his name to  differentiate himself from the original  Peter Parker while shameik Moore does an  excellent job voicing young Miles  Morales in the film many fans had their  hearts set on donald glover to portray  the young web slinger the atlanta  creator was pushed into the spider  spotlight when he half-jokingly campaign  to play the role of spider-man in 2010  while the role ultimately went to Andrew  Garfield Glover did voice Miles Morales  in the ultimate spider-man cartoon and  he even appeared in spider-man  homecoming as miles